    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1797_6639.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarlich</unclear> willig dienst, und was
<lb n="2"/>wir liebs und guots vermoegend zuvor, Edler,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrenvester</unclear> und Weiser, insonders lieber Herr
<lb n="4"/>Landtvogt, guoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freund</unclear> und nachbar.
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Auß</unclear> was <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ursachen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zugethone</unclear> burger,
<lb n="6"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lorentz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ksell</unclear></persName> und <persName resp="#ner">Johannes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Scheiterman</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ge</unclear>-
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trungen</unclear> worden, ihren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwager</unclear> herren <persName resp="#ner">Caspar
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Spegeren</unclear></persName> vor <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> mit recht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürzenemmen</unclear>,
<lb n="9"/>das werden ihr in anhoerung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eijn</unclear>-
<lb n="10"/>wendenden klag mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mehrerem</unclear> vernemmen.
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Weyl</unclear> nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> nit allain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> fürschrifft an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> umb
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürderliche</unclear> und schleünige expedition <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beystand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rahts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mittel</unclear> von
<lb n="13"/>ihnen gantz underthenig ersuocht und gebetten
<lb n="14"/>worden, haben wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> diß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> umb
<lb n="15"/>sovil weniger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verweigeren</unclear> koennen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wyl</unclear>
<lb n="16"/>wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gentzlich</unclear> darfür erachten, sie
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kein</unclear> unbilliche, sonder ein rechtmessige <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befügte</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>sach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">füehren</unclear>, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deroselben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stattschreiber</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Melchior</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Guldin</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beijstand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu-geordnet</unclear>.
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unnd</unclear> gelangt darauf an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, nach-
<lb n="20"/>barliches <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gesinnen</unclear>, ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellet</unclear>, in betrachtung
<lb n="21"/>angeregter ursach, sie nit allein guotwillig
<lb n="22"/>anhoeren, sondern auch, mit fürderlichem
<lb n="23"/>schleünigem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">proceß</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zur</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">billichkeit</unclear> ver-
<lb n="24"/>helffen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> gegentheils <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">suochenden</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gefaarlichen</unclear>
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">aufzügen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verlengerungen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spitzigen</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außflüchten</unclear> nit platz noch statt geben, und
<lb n="27"/>also <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear> gemelte <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsere</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgeren</unclear>, in allem
<lb n="28"/>dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jehnigen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wozu</unclear> sie fuog und recht haben moechten
<lb n="29"/>wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolchen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seijn</unclear> lassen,
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> daß sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">spüren</unclear> und uns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rüehmen</unclear> moegen,
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">diser</unclear> unser fürschrifft fruchtbarlich wol
<lb n="32"/>genossen haben. In massen wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euch</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1797_6640.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="33"/>dessen, und alles <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> willens, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnedas</unclear> wol
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrauwen</unclear>. Daran wirt die liebe
<lb n="35"/>justitia <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befürdret</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründt</unclear>-
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeßnes</unclear> gefallen, so wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> auch
<lb n="37"/>auf zuotragende begebenheiten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuerwideren</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear>. Gottes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obhalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> samtlich
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelhende</unclear>. Datum den. <origDate when="1612-09-18" resp="#ner">18. Septembris
<lb n="40"/>anno 1612</origDate>.
<lb n="41"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">B. und rhat</orgName>
<lb n="42"/>Dem edlen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrnvesten</unclear> weisen <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Beat</unclear> Jacob Freyen</persName>
<lb n="43"/>des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhats</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-10" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zug</placeName>, diser zeit landtvogt im oberen
<lb n="44"/>und nideren <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-103" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Thurgöw</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> sonders lieben
<lb n="45"/>herren, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear> und nachbaren.
</p>
